Hi,
I got the same message ("Error in contrasts(this_fixed_data) : contrasts apply only to factors"). However, I realized it was because I centered and scaled the continuous variable within the model. The solution was to scale the variable within the data frame (e.g. data$x.sc <http://x.sc><-scale(x)) and than use x.sc <http://x.sc> in the model instead of x.
Best
jörg

